  "uncertain": [
    "Image 3: board silkscreen shows a labeled \"GND\" test loop and a single pad under the text \"BAT-3V3\" (which may instead label jumper J3); neither was transcribed as a connector. Jumpers J1-J3 have no per-pin labels and were skipped."
  ],
  "notes": "H3 pin 1 is printed \"5V\" in image 1 and \"5V_OUT\" in image 3; copied as printed. Labels copied with the printed spacing (\"GPIO 66\" vs \"GPIO0\"). O/0 decided by context (IO0_TXD, I2S0_RX, SDA0). A faint ghost \"3.3V\"/\"3V\" text beside H1 in images 2 and 3 is an artwork remnant, not a pin label. 5V DC jack, antenna connectors and micro-USB skipped."
